  "body": "**Link to problem area**: https://spec.matrix.org/v1.4/client-server-api/#aggregations\r\n\r\n**Issue**\r\nThis is the content of the info box:\r\n\r\n> This specification does not currently describe any rel_types which require aggregation. This functionality forms a framework for future extensions. \r\n\r\nWhich is not true anymore with the threads and event replacements added in v1.4.\r\n\r\nI would have opened a PR directly to remove it but I'm not sure if it should instead be replaced by links to the corresponding sections of the spec for the different `rel_type`s, or something else.\r\n",
